MASTER GUIDE (what the whole picture shows; applies to every tile): {{userPrompt}}

CONTENT-TYPE RULES (Photo restoration / upscale): Photograph restoration. Remove noise, scratches, dust, blur and compression blocks, and recover genuine detail only where the photo hints at it. Faces and text are restored, never replaced: keep identity, expression, age and every character of text. Keep the tonal character of the photograph and a fine natural grain; do not smooth it into plastic. Do not colourise, retouch blemishes, change clothing or background, or invent content that is not visible.

{{fidelityClause}}
